===============================================
Random bits of code written by Jonathan Halcrow
===============================================

ngram_markov
	A script that generates random words using a Markov chain over ngrams
	of characters.

mondrian
      Some functions implementing the Mondrian Process

oldschool_12bolt
	Playtesting for an Atlantic 93/94 Old School 12 Bolt (URw Lion Dib
	Bolt) deck for the LOBSTERCON 2026 main event: a Monte Carlo flex-slot
	simulator (sim.py) and a two-player rules engine with an HTTP interface
	so LLM agents can pilot each side of real games (arena/). Decklist,
	results and the final report are in DECK.md.
